# Arguments to an activity are full arithmetic expressions.
# Regression: `with 1 plus 1` used to loop in the parser until OOM.
to add taking a, b
    return a plus b
!
set i as 4
set r by add with i plus 1 and 2
show r
set r by add with i times 2 and i minus 1
show r
repeat 3 times with k
    set r by add with k plus 1 and k modulo 2
    show r
!
